1. PURPOSE
=======================================================================

This AERIQ Proprietary Software License ("License") governs the use,
access, copying, modification, distribution, deployment, and other use
of the AERIQ software platform and its associated source code,
documentation, APIs, algorithms, models, databases, designs, and
related materials ("Software").

AERIQ is an intelligent Recirculating Aquaculture System (RAS) farm
management platform developed by Aero Intelli.

The Software is proprietary and is NOT open-source software.

